nly; no runner, VM, GitHub App, workflow, network policy, or platform ACL has been deployed\n- target storage remains unresolved, so the checked-in config permits stage 00 only\n- `automatic_pr_execution_enabled=false`\n- `go_live_authorized=false`\n- enabling Hyper-V and any required reboot remain explicit, separately acknowledged owner actions\n- the architecture remains **NO-GO** until the trusted runner is not addressable by candidate PR workflows and admission is controlled by the default branch/external controller\n\n## Validation\n\n- `npm run runner:windows-hyperv:config:check`\n- `npm run runner:windows-hyperv:bundle:check` — 29/29 checks passed\n- `npm run quality:report-index`\n- `python3 scripts/security/check_no_self_hosted_pull_request.py .github/workflows`\n- `npm run lint:changed`\n- `git diff --check origin/main...HEAD`\n- `npm run workflow:codex-preflight -- --json` — clean worktree; branch ahead 3, behind 0\n","created_at":"2026-07-13T06:49:45Z","updated_at":"2026-07-15T03:25:55Z","closed_at":"2026-07-15T03:14:16Z","merged_at":"2026-07-15T03:14:16Z","merge_commit_sha":"9841de9ff8c7007cbf4c32194d6c0d8c85b1bc3c","assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"labels":[],"milestone":null,"draft":false,"commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/pulls/1544/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/pulls/1544/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/issues/1544/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/statuses/fa2bbdb01c93794339ee15ddb0752f5f7247814a","head":{"label":"Samsen879:codex/windows-hyperv-runner-bootstrap","ref":"codex/windows-hyperv-runner-bootstrap","sha":"fa2bbdb01c93794339ee15ddb0752f5f7247814a","user":{"login":"Samsen879","id":172257175,"node_id":"U_kgDOCkRvlw","avatar_url":"